<p class="section__intro">Download and print these free resources to help you and your household prepare for emergencies. Keep printed copies at home and in your grab bag.</p>

<div class="alert-box alert-box--info">
  <p class="alert-box__heading">These are preparedness resources, not live emergency information.</p>
  <p>During an emergency, follow official guidance from HM Government of Gibraltar, the RGP and GBC Radio (91.3 FM / 1458 AM).</p>
</div>

<ul class="downloads-list">

  <li class="downloads-list__item">
    <div>
      <p class="downloads-list__title">Household Emergency Plan Template</p>
      <p>Fill in this template with your family's emergency plan — evacuation routes, ICE contacts, meeting points and special needs. Keep a printed copy at home and share with a trusted neighbour.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="downloads-list__formats">
      <a href="/assets/downloads/household-emergency-plan.pdf" class="downloads-list__format-link" download>Download PDF</a>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="downloads-list__item">
    <div>
      <p class="downloads-list__title">Grab Bag Checklist</p>
      <p>A printable checklist of recommended grab bag contents for a 72-hour emergency kit, with Gibraltar-specific notes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="downloads-list__formats">
      <a href="/assets/downloads/grab-bag-checklist.pdf" class="downloads-list__format-link" download>Download PDF</a>
    </div>
  </li>

  <li class="downloads-list__item">
    <div>
      <p class="downloads-list__title">Community Emergency Contact Sheet</p>
      <p>A one-page reference card with Gibraltar's key emergency contacts. Print it and stick it on your fridge, or keep it in your grab bag.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="downloads-list__formats">
      <a href="/assets/downloads/emergency-contact-sheet.pdf" class="downloads-list__format-link" download>Download PDF</a>
